  "ja495:42.2": "heṭṭhāmañce pasakkhitā, ",
  "ja495:42.3": "rājāno upari nahāyanti ",
  "ja495:42.4": "somayāge upaṭṭhite. ",
  "ja495:43.1": "malamajjakasamā rāja ",
